  "byline": "Tyler Cowen",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-13T20:51:16.000Z",
  "contentHtml": "<p>He and I were in the same Harvard class together, and spent a good deal of time talking economics together.&nbsp; We also were (briefly) bridge partners in a few games.&nbsp; I was a big fan of <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Fischer-Black-Revolutionary-Idea-Finance/dp/0471457329/ref=sr_1_1?crid=2F3EDG4J3LNBA&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.lOT0IGTSiyCeUKxHIKAqAbtcZR9r-ZPNAwQvnuBl_bTGjHj071QN20LucGBJIEps.2W8JoGzFB_jv1vXJRveQXsOZsJh6zRu0q6pNdJyBKxQ&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=perry+mehrling+fischer+black&amp;qid=1791923524&amp;sprefix=perry+mehrling+fischer+black%2Caps%2C141&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">his book on Fischer Black</a>.&nbsp; I am very sorry to see him <a href=\"https://x.com/int_mon_econ/status/2110094844475449514\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gone</a>.</p>",
